<h2 style="font-size: 38px; line-height: 1.12; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.025em">Talangin FAQ</h2>
<div style="margin-top: 32px; display: flex; flex-direction: column"><div style="border-top: 1px solid #EAECF0; padding: 22px 0"><h3 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">What is Talangin?</h3><p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; color: #475467; margin-top: 8px">Talangin is a PasarMIKRO service for Indonesian agricultural commodity traders and processors. When you have a purchase order or contract from a buyer, PasarMIKRO pays your supplier upfront, up to 75% of that purchase order. You reimburse PasarMIKRO when your buyer pays.</p></div><div style="border-top: 1px solid #EAECF0; padding: 22px 0"><h3 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">How much does PasarMIKRO pay upfront?</h3><p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; color: #475467; margin-top: 8px">Up to 75% of your buyer's purchase order or contract. The exact amount is set for each purchase order.</p></div><div style="border-top: 1px solid #EAECF0; padding: 22px 0"><h3 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">How is the fee set?</h3><p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; color: #475467; margin-top: 8px">The fee depends on the agreed payment terms. Your quote shows the fee for your purchase order and payment term.</p></div><div style="border-top: 1px solid #EAECF0; padding: 22px 0"><h3 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Which payment terms are possible?</h3><p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; color: #475467; margin-top: 8px">Typically between 3 and 45 days, in line with your buyer's payment terms.</p></div><div style="border-top: 1px solid #EAECF0; padding: 22px 0"><h3 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Who receives the payment?</h3><p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; color: #475467; margin-top: 8px">Your supplier, directly into their bank account. All major banks are supported, including BRI, BCA, Mandiri and BNI.</p></div><div style="border-top: 1px solid #EAECF0; padding: 22px 0"><h3 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">Who can apply?</h3><p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; color: #475467; margin-top: 8px">Traders and processors of agricultural commodities who sell to verified buyers under a purchase order or contract.</p></div><div style="border-top: 1px solid #EAECF0; border-bottom: 1px solid #EAECF0; padding: 22px 0"><h3 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700">How long does it take to get started?</h3><p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; color: #475467; margin-top: 8px">Up to 14 working days from your first quote, assuming complete documents.</p></div></div>
</div>
